%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChangingSubject
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'player is not interested in dealing with jessi''s emotions. they''re
    not necessary for this conversation. so, player decides to stick with a lighter
    subject: how''s she managing to deal with the hours?


    from what the player
    knows, jessi makes an effort to show up daily with little employees to help her
    around. such a schedule like that seems so demanding for someone like her, doesn''t
    it?


    jessi says that, while the customers are not pleasant to deal with,
    the actual job isn''t so bad. she was initially kind of hesitant to stick with
    what would seem to be a monotonous job, but having different orders kind of spices
    things up, especially with the stark difference between an order at a cafe and
    an order at a bar.


    the player laughs to herself and remarks how adorable
    it is that jessi is so satisfied by simple things like that. look at this filth
    getting satisfied by just doing something as simple as taking orders; so subservient...


    jessi
    gets a little flustered at the idea of submitting to these customers, arguing
    instead that she has the control over whether their orders are good or not. she
    knows the difference between a good and a bad drink, and anyone who pisses her
    off can just get fucked with a poison-adjacent mixture.


    suuuure, the player
    remarks. like jessi could ever have any semblance of dominance over anyone; she
    gets ordered around like a dog to satiate people''s addictions. in truth, she
    probably just loves fetching things for people and being an obedient little servant,
    huh? that''s why she shows up?


    jessi is even more flustered at the suggestion,
    but seems to oppose it a little less. she tries to deny it, but a small part
    of her is a little excited to be talked down like this (she''s not ready to explore
    that though.. at least Not Yet.)'
  _sameOptionTarget: 4
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm not really interested in having her be an emotional mess before
      I even outline my terms. She'll be in no state to accept at that point.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'll just have to direct this conversation elsewhere...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...Say, how do you manage to keep up with your hours anyway?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: From what I understand, you come to work on-time every day, with
      little to no extra help on the scene at that.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Doesn't that kind of daily schedule seem too...demanding of someone
      like you?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Eh, it's not that bad.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well, yeah, the customers are complete assholes, but the whole
      drink-mixing and food-serving thing is pretty easy if I'm gonna be honest.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Originally, I thought it was going to be so mindnumbingly boring...but
      you'd be surprised at how many people order crazy shit I've never seen before.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I swear some people just come in here asking me to make potions
      like I'm some sort of witch...it's honestly kind of hilarious seeing them try
      to come up with mixtures that'll straight up kill them.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Buuut I gotta go by safety protocol or whatever so this place
      doesn't get shut down, so there's limits I gotta enforce or whatever...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's also a little fun switching between a cafe and a bar every
      day; kinda keeps you on your toes...I guess.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hehe, so satisfied by such simple routines. It's quite adorable
      to see you trying to make the most of your experience.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: So happy to run around and take orders like a submissive little
      dog...it's cute.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: H-hey, that's NOT what it is!!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm not these people's servant or whatever; in fact, I'm the one
      that has the upper hand over them, okay??!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Sure, they ask me for the drink, but I get to control how good
      that drink is depending on if I think they deserve it!!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: People who piss me off can just chug straight-up toxins for all
      I care!!! Or well, as long as it's within safety code...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Suuuure. Like you could ever have any semblance of dominance over
      anyone.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You just get ordered about to satiate people's addictions without
      thought. I bet you like this job because you love being sooo obedient, don't
      you?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: That's why you show up every day, isn't it? To be reminded of
      how much you love surrendering control to other people?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Okay cut that out!!! That's\u2014just\u2014AGHHH STOP TALKING
      ABOUT IT!!!"
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Pfft, so simple, so easily excitable...what a piece of work.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Can she make her enjoyment of this any less obvious?
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 0
    _optionText: proceed
  _npcReplies:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ec327516f3321e4eb5435c01fb6219c, type: 2}
  _gameEnd: 0
